   "text": "PSIS CD Homework Launcher\n\nFiles:\n- index.html\n- manifest.webmanifest\n- sw.js\n- icon-192.png\n- icon-512.png\n\nPurpose:\nHost these files together on any HTTPS static website.\nOpen the hosted launcher page once on the phone and add it to the Home Screen.\nThe shortcut will use the PSIS icon and the name \"PSIS CD Homework\".\nAfter installation, tapping the icon opens the live Homework Tracker.\n\nLive tracker:\nhttps://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbyKu8R8uICJZ8A4puOPpU3XAJXftYLdU3b5et33LtX5TCQj5PdXMOn98VNWlkXDJ9qScQ/exec\n",
